<title>POLAND: OPTIMUS NOV NET FALLS TO PLN 0.7 MLN.</title>
<headline>OPTIMUS NOV NET FALLS TO PLN 0.7 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results November</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.67 vs   1.06</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 3.12 vs   1.59</p>
<p> Operating profit     4.57 vs   1.87</p>
<p> Sales		   57.20 vs  42.46</p>
<p>JANUARY-NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	    10.62 vs   8.37</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	20.27 vs  13.36</p>
<p> Operating profit    24.25 vs  12.03</p>
<p> Sales		  404.97 vs 272.00</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish software firm is Optimus SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
